<title>UK: Union de Credit pour le Batiment sets FRF bond.</title>
<headline>Union de Credit pour le Batiment sets FRF bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CNCA and Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNION DE CREDIT POUR LE BATIMENT DOMOS 2</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    2.2 BLN FRF   COUPON     3MP+10 BP MATURITY    25.MAR.15</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  =	   PAY DATE    25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     REOFFER    PAR	 MOODY	 AAA</p>
<p> RANK	 SENIOR</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    82.9 MLN	COUPON     3MP+37.5  MATURITY    25.MAR.15</p>
<p> MOODY  A3		RANK   SUBORDINATED  REOFFER     PAR</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p>PAY DATE 09.JUN.97 LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>    LISTING PARIS	LAW  FRENCH     DENOMS  10</p>
<p>    NEG PLG    NO	CRS DEFLT  NO   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>NOTES</p>
<p>SOLE LEAD ON TRANCHE B IS SUMITOMO FINANCE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
